        <mxCell id="124" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;align=left;" value="* Lower bound = inference endpoint only: claude-sonnet-4-6 ($3/$15 per M tokens), avg 500+500 tokens/req. Upper bound = agent+RAG endpoints: Sonnet orchestrator + Haiku subagents/judge + QueryAnalyzer + GroundingValidator embeddings ≈ 2,500–3,000 tokens/req total. RDS Multi-AZ db.t3.medium is the new dominant fixed cost (~$100/mo). PrivateLink second." vertex="1">
