          <mxGeometry height="30" width="300" x="40" y="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="401" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" value="1  Reduce Lambda memory 1024 MB → 512 MB — app is I/O-bound (LLM latency dominates). Halves compute cost with no measurable latency impact." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="730" x="40" y="640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="402" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" value="2  Remove PrivateLink (Secrets Manager Interface endpoint) at low traffic — replace with Gateway endpoint (free) or cache secrets in Parameter Store. Saves ~$15/mo fixed." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="730" x="40" y="694" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="403" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" value="3  Add Provisioned Concurrency (2 instances) instead of splitting Lambdas — eliminates cold starts for ~$7/mo extra, cheaper than managing separate functions." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="730" x="40" y="748" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="404" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" value="4  At &gt;1M req/mo — evaluate migrating inference to ECS Fargate. Fargate pricing is per vCPU/memory-hour, cheaper than Lambda at sustained high concurrency." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="730" x="40" y="802" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="405" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" value="5  LLM cost is 75–86%+ of the bill. Model-tier strategy already applied: Sonnet for orchestration, Haiku for subagents + judge. Further gains: prompt caching on long system prompts, reducing AGENT_MAX_STEPS for simpler queries, routing /v1/inference to Haiku when model is not specified by the caller." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="730" x="40" y="856" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
